    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67182" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετοικ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lead settlers to another abode</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				1352a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				264.7
			</span></i> (Pergam.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				7.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σφᾶς αὐτοὺς εἰς Ῥώμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς φρένας μ.</span>
			Melanth. Trag.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Μυτιλήνη σῶμα μετῳκίσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(2).443
				</span></i>
			 (Mytil.); also, <i>go to another country, emigrate</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				754
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Pun.</u>
				84
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν κλόνον εἰς ὃν ἡ ψυχὴ μετῳκίσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.232
				</span></i>
			. </div>
